<title>USA: Aetna Inc Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Aetna Inc Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr primary $0.77		    $0.98</p>
<p> Oper net	   122,400		  112,600</p>
<p> Revs		 4,152,300		3,191,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary 145,150		  114,370</p>
<p>			   MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr primary $2.39		    $2.87</p>
<p> Oper net	   312,200		  326,100</p>
<p> Revs		 10,619,800	     9,627,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary 126,138		  113,522</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 third quarter net figure includes results of U.S. Healthcare Inc from the date of its merger with Aetna on July 19 and $5.2 million in net realized capital gains.</p>
<p>1995 third quarter net income includes $1.5 million in net realized capital gains.</p>
<p>1996 third quarter net income was $122.4 million, or $0.77 per common share. 1995 third quarter net income was $212.1 million, or $1.86 per common share, including $99.5 million in earnings from the property-casualty unit sold in April 1996.</p>
<p>1996 nine-month net income was $758.1 million, or $5.92 per common share, compared with $76.0 million, or $0.67 per common share for nine months of 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
